      "name": "AllocateTileTextureBuffers",
      "signature": "void AllocateTileTextureBuffers(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Allocates texture staging buffers for Glide tile rendering.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Allocate subtile texture buffer (0x400 = 1024 bytes, 32x32 pixels)\n  2. Allocate floor tile texture buffer (0x8000 = 32768 bytes, 256x128 pixels)\n  3. Store buffer pointers in global variables for texture operations\n\n  Parameters:\n  None - This function takes no parameters\n\n  Returns:\n  void - No return value\n\n  Special Cases:\n  - Called once during Glide initialization from InitializeGlide\n  - Buffers are freed by FreeTextureBuffers (FUN_6f8713a0) on shutdown\n  - Subtile buffer used by FUN_6f871690 for 32x32 subtile component textures\n  - Floor tile buffer used by FUN_6f8713f0 for 256x128 floor tile textures\n\n  Memory Layout:\n  Offset  Size    Global                        Description\n  ------  ------  ----------------------------  ---------------------------\n  N/A     0x400   g_pSubtileTextureBuffer       32x32 subtile staging buffer\n  N/A     0x8000  g_pFloorTileTextureBuffer     256x128 floor tile staging",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
