      "name": "ProcessTileProjectBuffer",
      "signature": "uint ProcessTileProjectBuffer(TileProject * pTileProject)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Processes and decodes tile project data into graphics buffer\\nAllocates buffer, decompresses tile cel data, and uploads to graphics hardware\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n  1. Allocate tile project buffer via AllocateTileProjectBuffer\\n  2. If cache index valid (>= 0): decompress and render tiles to texture\\n     - Clear 0x2000 (8192) DWORD buffer at g_pbTileBufferBase\\n     - For each of 0x50 tile entries: decompress cel data to buffer\\n     - Handle two compression formats: 4-byte stride OR variable-length encoded\\n  3. Else: apply existing cached tile index\\n  4. Upload texture via grTexDownloadMipMap with format 3\\n  5. Bind texture source via grTexSource\\n\\nParameters:\\n  pTileProject (ECX)  pointer to TileProject structure (272 bytes)\\n                      contains tile count (0x50), tile list ptr (0x54), cache index (0x42)\\n\\nReturns:\\n  EAX = 1 if successful, 0 if allocation failed\\n  Sets EAX = 0xFFFFFFFF on assertion failures",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
