      "name": "InitializeGlideWindow",
      "signature": "int InitializeGlideWindow(uint dwBinkRender, int nVideoMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initializes the Glide graphics window for rendering.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Check if window already open (g_bGlideWindowOpen != 0), return 1 if so\n  2. Call internal initialization FUN_6f871b20 with parameters\n  3. If init fails (returns 0), return 0\n  4. Clear the graphics buffer with grBufferClear(0, 0, 0)\n  5. Check vsync setting at *(g_pGraphicsConfig + 0x10)\n  6. Call grBufferSwap(1) if vsync enabled, grBufferSwap(0) otherwise\n  7. Return 1 on success\n\n  Parameters:\n    dwBinkRender (ECX) - Bink video render mode flag\n    nVideoMode (EDX) - Video mode: 0=640x480, non-zero=800x600\n\n  Returns:\n    1 - Success (window opened or already open)\n    0 - Failure (internal initialization failed)\n\n  Globals:\n    g_bGlideWindowOpen (0x6f885438) - Flag indicating window is open\n    g_pGraphicsConfig (0x6f885348) - Pointer to graphics config structure\n      +0x10: Vsync enable flag",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:546c17e22a38a8e15c8829671ea3e893",
