      "name": "GetColorValue",
      "signature": "uint GetColorValue(uint dwColorIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Retrieves and formats a color value from the color palette table.\n  \n  Algorithm:\n  1. Load color value from g_aColorPalette at offset dwColorIndex * 4\n  2. Shift result left by 0x8 bits to position in rendering format\n  3. Return formatted color value\n  \n  Parameters: dwColorIndex - Index into g_aColorPalette color array\n              (typically 0x00 to 0xFF for palette colors)\n  \n  Returns: Color value shifted left 8 bits, ready for rendering (BGR format)\n  \n  Special Cases: Color index is bounds-checked by array access;\n  out-of-bounds access will use palette entry at computed offset",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
