      "name": "SetAlphaBlendMode",
      "signature": "void SetAlphaBlendMode(int nMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets the global alpha blend mode via a dispatch table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Load current mode from g_dwCurrentAlphaMode\n  2. If parameter equals current mode, return (no change)\n  3. Use parameter as index into jump table (cases 0-3)\n  4. Call grAlphaCombine with mode-specific parameters\n  5. Call grAlphaBlendFunction with mode-specific blend factors\n  6. Store new mode in g_dwCurrentAlphaMode\n\nParameters:\n  nMode [ECX] - Blend mode selector (0-3)\n    0: Mode 0 (src=0, dst=2, func=0)\n    1: Mode 1 (src=1, dst=2, func=1, alt dst=4)\n    2: Mode 2 (src=1, dst=2, func=0, alt dst=2)\n    3: Mode 3 (src=1, dst=2, func=1, alt dst=5)\n\nReturns:\n  void - modifies global state only\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset | Size | Name                 | Type   | Description\n  0x0    | 4    | g_dwCurrentAlphaMode | dword  | Current alpha blend mode",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:1d36d1ce340a6c7c0d1568674e064a7e",
