      "comment": "Retrieves a graphics configuration value from the global graphics config structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Load address of global graphics config pointer (0x6f885348)\n  2. Dereference pointer to get config structure\n  3. Access field at offset 0x14 within the structure\n  4. Return the DWORD value\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  EAX - Configuration value as DWORD (typically a flag, mode, or setting)",
