      "comment": "Initializes light source array data structures with light calculations\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Initialize light source data array at 0x6f8867f0 with 6x6 grid of structures\n     - Set intensity (field +0xc) to 1.0 (0x3f800000)\n     - Compute X and Y coordinates using floating-point calculations\n     - Store computed values in fields +0x10 and +0x8 (FMUL with scale factors)\n  2. Populate light source index table at 0x6f886be4\n     - Pairs of pointers: [-0x4] points to offset variant, [0x0] points to base data\n     - Iterate through 6x6 grid with stride of 0x1c bytes per element\n     - Link indices across entire lookup array\n\nParameters:\n  None (no parameters)\n\nReturns:\n  None (void return)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Uses FPU (x87) for floating-point arithmetic and conversion (__ftol)\n  - Heavy stack usage for temporary float conversions (8 bytes allocated)\n  - Register reuse: EBX and EBP for outer loop counter and 1.0 constant\n  - Nested loops: 6x6 grid iteration (36 total iterations)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
