      "name": "AllocateTextureCacheIndex",
      "signature": "int AllocateTextureCacheIndex(TextureCache * pCache)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Allocates a texture cache index from the free list for hardware texture storage.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. If cache not full (nNumItems != nMaxNumItems):\n     a. Pop item from free list (pFreeHead)\n     b. Update free list pointers\n     c. Add item to active list tail (pActiveTail)\n     d. Increment nNumItems\n     e. Return index+1 if valid (item->nIndex != -1)\n  2. If item invalid (-1) or cache full, recycle oldest active item:\n     a. Pop oldest from active list head (pActiveHead)\n     b. Clear tile's cache index (offset 0x42 = sCacheIndex)\n     c. Return item to free list\n     d. Decrement nNumItems\n  3. Retry allocation from step 1\n  4. If still invalid, assert INVALID_HARDWARE_ADDRESS\n\nParameters:\n  pCache (ECX)  Pointer to TextureCache structure (32 bytes)\n\nReturns:\n  EAX = Cache index + 1 (1-based) on success\n  EAX = Result of FUN_6f878859(-1) on assertion failure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns early if allocated item has valid hardware address (nIndex != -1)\n  - Recycles LRU item if cache full or item has invalid address\n  - Clears associated tile's sCacheIndex (offset 0x42) when recycling\n\nStructure Layout (TextureCache):\n  Offset  Size  Field         Type                Description\n  0x00    4     dwItemSize    uint                Size per cache item data\n  0x04    4     nMaxNumItems  int                 Maximum items in cache\n  0x08    4     nNumItems     int                 Current active item count\n  0x0C    4     pActiveHead   TextureCacheItem*   Head of in-use list (oldest)\n  0x10    4     pActiveTail   TextureCacheItem*   Tail of in-use list (newest)\n  0x14    4     pFreeHead     TextureCacheItem*   Head of free list\n  0x18    4     pFreeTail     TextureCacheItem*   Tail of free list\n  0x1C    4     pItemPool     TextureCacheItem*   Allocated item array\n\nStructure Layout (TextureCacheItem):\n  Offset  Size  Field         Type                Description\n  0x00    4     nIndex        int                 Cache index (-1 = invalid)\n  0x04    4     dwDataAddr    uint                Texture memory address\n  0x08    4     pTile         TileProject*        Associated tile pointer\n  0x0C    4     pNext         TextureCacheItem*   Next item in list\n  0x10    4     pPrev         TextureCacheItem*   Previous item in list",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
