      "name": "GetGraphicsBackgroundColor",
      "signature": "uint GetGraphicsBackgroundColor(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Get the current graphics background color from global config.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Load the graphics config structure pointer from global variable\n    2. Check if the config is valid (non-zero at offset 0x4)\n    3. Return the background color value at offset 0x0, or 0 if invalid\n\n  Parameters:\n    (none)\n\n  Returns:\n    EAX: DWORD color value, or 0 if graphics config is not initialized",
