      "name": "SetGlideTextureData",
      "signature": "void SetGlideTextureData(uint dwData, uint dwSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Stores texture data pointer and size to global variables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Store ECX (dwData) to global g_dwGlideTextureData\n  2. Store EDX (dwSize) to global g_dwGlideTextureSize\n  3. Return\n\nParameters:\n  ECX: dwData - Pointer to texture data\n  EDX: dwSize - Size of texture data in bytes\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Overwrites previous texture data values without cleanup",
