      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize Glide texture cache size to 256 (0x100) MB.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Set global Glide texture cache size to 0x100 (256 in decimal)\n    2. Return\n\n  Parameters:\n    None\n\n  Returns:\n    void\n\n  Purpose:\n    Initializes the Glide graphics subsystem texture cache size parameter\n    during startup configuration. The value 0x100 represents the cache\n    size in some unit (likely 256 MB or similar).",
