      "name": "ClearSpritesAndLoadSmackVideo",
      "signature": "void ClearSpritesAndLoadSmackVideo(int * pFilePtr, int * pSmackState)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes sprite buffers and optionally loads Smack video file.\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Verify g_pSpriteBuffer2 is valid (0x2000 DWORDs allocated)\n  2. Clear three sprite buffers: g_pSpriteBuffer2, g_pSpriteBuffer0, g_pSpriteBuffer1 (0x2000 DWORDs each = 8192 DWORDs)\n  3. If g_dwGameAbort is 0, download two mipmap textures via grTexDownloadMipMap\n  4. Process operation: if 'p' load file, if 's' open Smack video\n  5. Clean up: Close Smack file if open, clear state\nParameters:\n  pFilePtr (ECX): File path string or Smack handle\n  pSmackState (EDX): Smack state structure [0]=handle, [1]=operation flag\nReturns:\n  None (void)\nSpecial Cases:\n  Assert if g_pSpriteBuffer2 is NULL",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:1de091de38a0c8104999bec46fd52d0f",
