      "name": "ProcessSmackFrame",
      "signature": "void ProcessSmackFrame(SmackHandle * pHandle)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Process single frame of Smack/Bink video playback\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Check mode byte at pHandle->mode: 'p' (0x70) or 's' (0x73)\n  2. If sprite mode ('s'): load Smack handle from pHandle->handle\n  3. Call SmackWait to determine if frame ready for rendering\n  4. If ready (SmackWait returns 0) and g_dwBinkRender enabled:\n     - Render frame via SmackDoFrame\n     - Compare playback position with end to detect completion\n     - If complete: close file, clear handle, set mode to 0x00\n     - Else: advance frame via SmackNextFrame\n  5. Download sprite mipmap to GPU if playback continuing\n  6. If palette mode ('p'): process with offset 0x1d4\n\nParameters:\n  pHandle - SmackHandle pointer (register ECX)\n\nReturns:\n  void - modifies structure contents, clears handle when done",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:9571798eba8e4e1e3fc3dbc773203688",
