      "name": "LoadAndDrawCelTexture",
      "signature": "int LoadAndDrawCelTexture(CelFile * pCelFile, uint dwTextureCacheId)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Loads CEL frame into texture cache and downloads to graphics device\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve skill data for frame index (0 if not provided)\n2. Determine texture quality tier based on pixel count (0x1001, 0x4001, 0x10000)\n3. Check if texture already cached and valid\n4. If new texture needed:\n   - Allocate cache slot via FUN_6f8771d0\n   - Set cache entry pointer, index, and size\n   - Clear decompression and highlight buffers to 0x00\n5. Decode frame data using D2CMP_DecodeAndDrawCelFrame\n6. Apply palette remapping for transparency frames (tier 2) or highlight map (tier 3)\n7. Upload texture to graphics device via grTexDownloadMipMap\n8. Set texture source and combine state\n\nParameters:\n  pCelFile [ECX]  - Pointer to CelFile structure\n  dwTextureCacheId [EDX] - Cache entry identifier\n\nReturns:\n  1 on success, 0 if texture dimensions exceed 0x10000\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Assertion failures trigger FUN_6f878859(-1) fatal error\n  - Fullscreen mode affects multi-TMU texture support flag\n  - Frame tier 3 allocates highlight buffer (g_pHighlightBuffer) for edge pixels",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
