      "name": "InitializeGlideCache",
      "signature": "int InitializeGlideCache(dword * pCache, int nStartOffset, dword dwEndOffset, dword dwElementSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initializes a Glide texture/resource cache structure with linked list nodes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Calculate element count: (dwEndOffset - nStartOffset) / dwElementSize\n  2. Store element size and count in cache structure\n  3. Allocate contiguous cache node array (count * 0x14 bytes per node)\n  4. Zero-initialize all cache nodes\n  5. Link cache nodes in doubly-linked list structure:\n     - Each node offset: 0x0 (index), 0x4 (data_ptr), 0xc (next), 0x10 (prev)\n  6. Initialize cache control fields:\n     - offset 0x14: first node pointer\n     - offsets 0x8-0x10: state/accounting fields\n     - offset 0x18: last node pointer\n  7. If UMA not supported, find first valid cache block crossing 0x200000 boundary\n\nParameters:\n  pCache: Cache control structure (array of pointers)\n  nStartOffset: Starting offset in memory region\n  dwEndOffset: Ending offset in memory region\n  dwElementSize: Size of each cache element in bytes\n\nReturns:\n  EAX: Calculated element count * dwElementSize + register value",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:901136b323a27f878695b69c6d0b1d5e",
