      "name": "InsertSubtile",
      "signature": "void InsertSubtile(TileProject * pTile, int nComponentIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Inserts a subtile component into a linked list within the tile project structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Validate tile parameter (pTile) exists (offset 0x8 > 0x0)\n  2. Validate nComponentIndex bounds: if EDX=0, fail; if EDX > max, fail\n  3. Call FUN_6f876ed0 with pTile to get next element in linked list\n  4. If no previous element exists, set as head (offset 0xc)\n  5. If previous element exists, insert between previous and next using offsets 0xc/0x10\n\nParameters:\n  pTile (ECX)         TileProject* - pointer to tile project structure\n  nComponentIndex (EDX) int - component index to insert\n\nReturns:\n  void - updates the tile structure in-place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Calls FogAssert() on validation failures at lines 0xba, 0xbb, 0xbc\n  - Handles empty list (no previous element at offset 0xc)\n  - Handles non-empty list (existing elements at offset 0xc/0x10)",
