      "comment": "Stores three byte values to global state array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Write byState1 to g_abyGlobalState[2]\n  2. Write byState2 to g_abyGlobalState[1]\n  3. Write byState3 to g_abyGlobalState[0]\n  4. Return with stack adjustment\n\nParameters:\n  byState1  First state byte (passed in AL, stored at offset +2)\n  byState2  Second state byte (passed in CL, stored at offset +1)\n  byState3  Third state byte (passed in DL, stored at offset +0)\n\nReturns:\n  void  Function returns after storing all three bytes",
