      "name": "RenderTileProjectComponents",
      "signature": "int RenderTileProjectComponents(int pTileProject, int nOffsetX, int nOffsetY, byte byColorIndex, int nUnused)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Renders visible tile components from a TileProject structure as textured quads.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Call GetClipBounds (FUN_6f877850) to get screen clipping rectangle\n  2. If TileProject has no components (count at +0x50 <= 0), return 0\n  3. For each tile component (array at +0x54, stride 0x14 (20) bytes):\n     a. Calculate screen X = component.offsetX + nOffsetX\n     b. Calculate screen Y = component.offsetY + nOffsetY + 0x20 (32)\n     c. If position is within clip bounds:\n        - Process tile texture via ProcessTileComponent\n        - Build 4-vertex quad (32x32 pixels) in global GrVertex array at 0x6f887100\n        - Set color from palette using byColorIndex\n        - Draw quad using grDrawVertexArrayContiguous(5, 4, vertices, 0x1c)\n  4. Return 1 if any tiles rendered, 0 otherwise\n\n  Parameters:\n    pTileProject (ECX)  Pointer to TileProject structure\n                        +0x50: dword count of tile components\n                        +0x54: pointer to tile component array (stride 0x14)\n    nOffsetX (EDX)      X offset added to each tile's position\n    nOffsetY            Y offset added to each tile's position\n    byColorIndex        Palette index for tile coloring\n    nUnused             Passed to GetClipBounds but unused (scroll mode?)\n\n  Returns:\n    1 (TRUE)  At least one tile component was rendered\n    0 (FALSE) No tile components rendered (empty or all clipped)\n\n  Tile Component Layout (0x14 bytes per entry):\n    +0x00: short  X offset relative to tile origin\n    +0x02: short  Y offset relative to tile origin\n    +0x04: short  Cache index (used by ProcessTileComponent)\n    +0x10: ptr    Compressed texture data pointer\n\n  GrVertex Array Layout (4 vertices, 0x1c bytes each):\n    Vertex 0 (0x6f887100): Top-left     (X, Y-32)\n    Vertex 1 (0x6f88711c): Bottom-left  (X, Y)\n    Vertex 2 (0x6f887138): Bottom-right (X+32, Y)\n    Vertex 3 (0x6f887154): Top-right    (X+32, Y-32)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:e308af47a7245c16e211fd72ec2633a6",
